.TH PARCEL\-EVENTS\-CLI\-LABELS 1 "Doctorine" "1.8.4"
.SH NAME
parcel\-events\-cli\-labels \- labels commands for parcel\-events\-cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B parcel\-events\-cli labels
<verb> [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Group page for \fBlabels\fR. One page per group, not per leaf.
Stable bind id is \fBx\-operation\-key\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP "labels create"
POST /v1/labels
.IP "labels retrieve"
GET /v1/labels/{label_id}
.SH SEE ALSO
parcel\-events\-cli(1), COMMANDS.md, SKILL.md
